{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender dna catalog blender dna catalog","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md","fileName":"Blender DNA Catalog.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender DNA Catalog","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender DNA and File Loading]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender DNA1 Block","Blender Blend File Block","Blender SDNA Metadata","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender dna catalog blender dna catalog","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender DNA Catalog.md","fileName":"Blender DNA Catalog.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender DNA Catalog","heading":"Blender DNA Catalog","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The repository's `BlendFileReader.py` represents the [[Blender DNA1 Block]] as a `DNACatalog`. The catalog reads the name table, type table, type sizes, and structure definitions into related Python objects after applying the alignment rules of the binary file.\n\nA `BlendFile` instance stores this catalog alongside its block headers and file-header information. Client code can use the SDNA index in a [[Blender Blend File Block]] to identify its DNA type, which makes the catalog a practical inspection view of [[Blender SDNA Metadata]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender DNA1 Block","Blender Blend File Block","Blender SDNA Metadata","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Not